        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "手: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "With a compatible substance, 一手 can describe coverage over the hands rather than a general count of objects. Contrast this with 一手好字, where the same frame describes a skill or style of handwriting, not a substance on the hands.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "一手水",
                "pinyin": "yī shǒu shuǐ",
                "meaning": "Water all over one’s hands, describing coverage.",
